      "writtenOn": "2024-03-14T21:13:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We could do this as 2 flags or 1.\n\nSingle flag (scanManagerRefactor) when on would:\n1. Start/stop ScanManagerService in bringUpBle/bringDownBle (with appropriate renaming). When off it would continue to start/stop GattService only\n2. When starting/stopping all profiles start GattService as well\n3. Don\u0027t start a scan helper instance within GattService\n\nFor two flags (scanManagerRefactor, let\u0027s call the other one for now scanOnOnly) - scanManagerRefactor when on would:\n1. Bring up both GattService and ScanManagerService in bringUpBle/bringDownBle\n2. Don\u0027t start a scan helper instance within GattService\nscanOnOnly when on would:\n1. Stop bringing up/down GattService in bringUpBle/bringDownBle\n2. When starting/stopping all profiles start GattService as well\n\nWith 2 flags the 2nd one would be dependent on the first.",
      "parentUuid": "c8afb45b_68f38621",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1016,
        "startChar": 6,
        "endLine": 1019,
        "endChar": 9
